    ===============================================================================
    =                       W H A T   I T   D O E S                               =
    ===============================================================================

     Lattice builds a live ontology of your Databricks environment.

     Every Unity Catalog asset, compute resource, job, dashboard, app,
     serving endpoint, vector search index, Genie space, and connected
     system -- mapped as typed entities with semantic relationships,
     enriched with operational intelligence from system tables.

     Built for data teams and AI agents alike.

       * MODELS    - 23 node types, 16+ edge types, full knowledge graph
       * DISCOVERS - catalogs, schemas, tables, views, models, volumes,
                     warehouses, clusters, jobs, dashboards, apps,
                     pipelines, shares, connections, serving endpoints,
                     vector search indexes, genie spaces
       * CONNECTS  - structural, compute, lineage, AI, federation edges
       * ENRICHES  - DBU spend, query frequency, heat, job success, tags
       * VISUALIZES - interactive canvas, layouts, search, filters
       * ANALYZES  - cost attribution, impact analysis, orphan detection
       * EXPORTS   - JSON + JSON-LD for AI agent consumption


