     NODE TYPES (23):

       UC Data       : Catalog, ForeignCatalog, Schema, Table, View,
                       Model, Volume, StreamingTable, MaterializedView
       Compute       : Warehouse, Serverless, Cluster, Job, Dashboard,
                       App, Pipeline
       AI/ML         : ServingEndpoint, VectorSearchIndex, GenieSpace
       Federation    : Connection, Share, Recipient, Database

     EDGE TYPES (16+):

       Structural    : contains
       Compute       : runsOn, triggers
       Data          : queries, uses, derivedFrom
       Lineage       : feedsInto, writesTo, readsFrom
       Federation    : exposes, includes
       AI/ML         : serves, indexesFrom, embeddedBy

     CANVAS:

