    ===============================================================================
    =                        L I N E A G E                                        =
    ===============================================================================

       Table -> Table    feedsInto (blue dashed, toggleable)
       Job -> Table      writesTo + readsFrom (from table_lineage)
       View -> Table     derivedFrom (cyan solid, from view_dependencies)
       Dashboard -> Table  parsed from Lakeview dataset SQL
       Column lineage    per-column source tracing in detail panel

       LINEAGE BACKFILL:

         After fetching lineage, Lattice identifies jobs and tables
         referenced in lineage but missing from the primary ingestion.
         It backfills them via individual API calls so the full
         Job -> Table -> View chain connects end-to-end.

       LIMITATIONS:

         - 30-day window (monthly pipelines may be missing)
         - system.query.history only captures SQL warehouse queries
         - Spark-only tables appear as "cold"
         - Default limits cap rows/backfill (configurable in Advanced)


